OL,3,GNEWSANew bus route to replace former
OL,4,ACT4N service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus service that was cut when an
OL,7,Foperator ceased trading and made the
OL,8,Fmajority of staff redundant is to be
OL,9,Freplaced with a new route.
OL,11,FCommunity Transport for Nottingham
OL,12,F(CT4N), which had run more than 20
OL,13,Froutes, said on 14 August that steps
OL,14,Fwere being taken to place the firm
OL,15,Fformally into administration.
OL,17,FOne of its services, the L2 Local Link
OL,18,Ffrom Nottingham to Assarts Farm, will
OL,19,Fbe replaced from 1 September by an
OL,20,Fextension to Nottingham City
OL,21,FTransport's (NCT's) Turquoise 78 from
OL,22,FStrelley.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
