OL,3,GNEWSANew bus route to replace former
OL,4,ACT4N service
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the same day, NCT will begin a full
OL,7,F18 timetable including the 18A, 18B and
OL,8,F18X routes. It took over the basic 18
OL,9,Fservice between Nottingham and
OL,10,FStapleford three days after CT4N ceased
OL,11,Frunning.
